r['hand'].append('Blind audit: distinguish a raised open lambda_i from the closed loop of l, a solid low bullet from a star, and a small oval-plus-shallow-u spelling ou from an operator sequence. Two points lying wholly below a word’s baseline do not establish punctuation. The looped sign after ! has no separate question-mark dot and remains a brace/question/parenthesis ambiguity.')
